    "synopsis": "This documentary goes behind the scenes at Abbey Road Studios to capture the recording of the Mercury Prize\u2013nominated HELP(2), a 2026 charity album from War Child Records, which aids children in conflict zones around the world. To make the film, Glazer enlisted some crucial help: young schoolkids from London were equipped with their own digital cameras and encouraged to shoot the studio recordings any way they wanted. Their curiosity and creativity are paralleled in footage taken by high-spirited children in war-torn parts of the globe\u2014Gaza, Sudan, Ukraine, Yemen\u2014whom Glazer also supplied with cameras. The resulting film, which Glazer and regular music collaborator Mica Levi have dubbed \u201cby children, for children,\u201d serves as a testament to youthful openness and wonder amidst the evils of the adult world.",
